## Status Lifecycle

```text
NEW
    |
    v
PROCESSING
    |
    |-- success --> PROCESSED
    |
    |-- failure and attempts left --> NEW
    |
    |-- failure and max attempts reached --> FAILED
```

Recommended meaning:

| Status | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `NEW` | Event is ready to process |
| `PROCESSING` | Worker claimed the event |
| `PROCESSED` | Event completed successfully |
| `FAILED` | Event failed permanently after max retries |

